        413.2803039550781,
        190.99270629882812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "schedule. We train for 1000 epochs with warmup enabled for",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        196.71331787109375,
        563.0355834960938,
        205.619873046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the first 4 epochs. For the disk tracking task we use a batch",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        208.6683349609375,
        563.035400390625,
        217.57489013671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "size of 50, while for global localization the batch size is 100.",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        220.62432861328125,
        563.0352783203125,
        229.5308837890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For KITTI visual odometry and robotic manipulation task, due",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        232.579345703125,
        563.035400390625,
        241.48590087890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "to the fold-based training protocol, the batch size varies across",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        244.53436279296875,
        563.0352172851562,
        253.44091796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "folds. Full configurations are provided in our released code.",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        256.4893798828125,
        557.7552490234375,
        265.39593505859375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A. Vision-based Disk Tracking",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        281.1430358886719,
        437.1380920410156,
        289.7308044433594
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Overview: The objective is to estimate the motion path of a",
      "bbox": [
        321.94000244140625,
        295.8348083496094,
        563.0349731445312,
        304.8609313964844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "specific disk within a crowded two-dimensional environment",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        307.90936279296875,
        563.0355224609375,
        316.81591796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "where numerous distractor disks move simultaneously. The",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        319.8643493652344,
        563.0354614257812,
        328.7709045410156
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "position of the target disk is treated as the latent state. The",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        331.8203430175781,
        563.035400390625,
        340.7268981933594
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "main challenge of this task lies in the varying degrees of",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        343.77532958984375,
        563.0355224609375,
        352.681884765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "occlusion that occur during the target’s movement, as shown",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        355.7303161621094,
        563.035400390625,
        364.6368713378906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "in Fig. 3, which introduces dynamic uncertainty into the",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        367.685302734375,
        563.035400390625,
        376.59185791015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "observations. For filtering methods, it is essential to effectively",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        379.6402893066406,
        563.0355834960938,
        388.5468444824219
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "leverage both the temporal information derived from prediction",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        391.59527587890625,
        563.035400390625,
        400.5018310546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and the information extracted from the current observations.",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        403.55126953125,
        558.7116088867188,
        412.45782470703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Data: We follow exactly the same dataset and simulation",
      "bbox": [
        321.94000244140625,
        415.1936950683594,
        563.034912109375,
        424.2198181152344
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "setup as in [10]. The dataset consists of 500 training and 50",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        427.26824951171875,
        563.0355834960938,
        436.1748046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "testing sequences, each containing 50 RGB frames of size",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        439.2232360839844,
        563.0354614257812,
        448.1297912597656
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "128×128. Each frame includes one target disk and 25 distractor",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        451.1792297363281,
        563.0355834960938,
        460.0857849121094
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "disks, initialized uniformly at random. The target red disk has",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        463.13421630859375,
        563.035400390625,
        472.040771484375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "a fixed radius of 7 pixels, while distractors vary in size and",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        475.0892028808594,
        563.0354614257812,
        483.9957580566406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "color. The disk dynamics follow the same formulation as in",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        487.044189453125,
        563.0354614257812,
        495.95074462890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "[14].",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        498.9991760253906,
        331.0663146972656,
        507.9057312011719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Implementation: At time step t, we use the given velocity",
      "bbox": [
        321.94000244140625,
        510.6028137207031,
        563.0350952148438,
        519.6687622070312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "v∗",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        521.2335205078125,
        322.0716857910156,
        532.0115966796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "t as input to generate a prior estimate of x(i)",
      "bbox": [
        317.6230163574219,
        520.06396484375,
        496.7730712890625,
        534.6937866210938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "t−1. The following",
      "bbox": [
        487.7350158691406,
        523.32421875,
        563.0398559570312,
        534.0887451171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "formulation serves as our process model:",
      "bbox": [
        311.97802734375,
        535.2791748046875,
        480.3359069824219,
        544.1857299804688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ˆx(i)",
      "bbox": [
        399.9060363769531,
        550.449951171875,
        415.50909423828125,
        562.3975830078125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "t",
      "bbox": [
        406.4710388183594,
        558.0769653320312,
        409.4837341308594,
        564.2697143554688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "= x(i)",
      "bbox": [
        418.78204345703125,
        550.449951171875,
        444.902099609375,
        562.3975830078125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "t−1 + v∗",
      "bbox": [
        435.8640441894531,
        551.1214599609375,
        471.8397216796875,
        565.0545654296875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "t .",
      "bbox": [
        467.39105224609375,
        553.55078125,
        475.1096496582031,
        564.860595703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "(10)",
      "bbox": [
        546.44189453125,
        553.710205078125,
        563.0396728515625,
        562.6167602539062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Due to the imperfection of the process model, observation ot",
      "bbox": [
        311.9780578613281,
        571.374755859375,
        562.540771484375,
        581.1357421875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "is used to correct the prior estimate. We adopt the network",
      "bbox": [
        311.97808837890625,
        583.4891967773438,
        563.0357055664062,
        592.395751953125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "architecture from [10] as our sensor model. To integrate",
      "bbox": [
        311.97808837890625,
        595.4442138671875,
        563.03564453125,
        604.3507690429688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "{ˆx(i)",
      "bbox": [
        311.97808837890625,
        604.7459716796875,
        332.56317138671875,
        616.693603515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "t }N",
      "bbox": [
        323.5251159667969,
        606.3059692382812,
        344.3603820800781,
        619.1455688476562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "i=1 with ot, we first convert the {ˆx(i)",
      "bbox": [
        338.0491027832031,
        604.7459716796875,
        512.2152099609375,
        619.5067749023438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "t }N",
      "bbox": [
        503.1771545410156,
        606.3059692382812,
        524.013427734375,
        619.1455688476562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "i=1 into a",
      "bbox": [
        517.7021484375,
        608.0062255859375,
        563.0318603515625,
        619.5067749023438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "heatmap. The observation ot is encoded by the sensor model,",
      "bbox": [
        311.9781494140625,
        619.802734375,
        563.0367431640625,
        630.3627319335938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "while the heatmap is processed by a separate network with",
      "bbox": [
        311.9781188964844,
        631.9171752929688,
        563.0357055664062,
        640.82373046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the same architecture. The outputs of both networks are then",
      "bbox": [
        311.9781188964844,
        643.8721923828125,
        563.0357055664062,
        652.7787475585938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "concatenated to form the feature representation ct, which are",
      "bbox": [
        311.9781188964844,
        655.6677856445312,
        563.0394287109375,
        665.4287109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "used as conditions for the diffusion model.",
      "bbox": [
        311.97808837890625,
        667.7822265625,
        487.8875732421875,
        676.6887817382812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Results: We evaluate our proposed DiffPF across three",
      "bbox": [
        321.9400939941406,
        679.4255981445312,
        563.0350341796875,
        688.4517211914062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "dimensions:",
      "bbox": [
        311.97808837890625,
        691.5001831054688,
        360.13726806640625,
        700.40673828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "1) Benchmarking. We compare the DiffPF with several",
      "bbox": [
        321.9400939941406,
        703.103759765625,
        563.03515625,
        712.1697387695312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
